{"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"269:## Roadmap\n270-\n271-- **Qwen Code's headless one-shot mode kills a hook mid-write** — verified on\n272-  Qwen Code 0.21.5: `qwen -p \"...\"` fires its `Stop` hook and exits\n273-  immediately, tearing down the hook process with the stdio pipes it\n274-  inherited. A hook that returns instantly survives; a git-notes append does\n275-  not, and nothing is captured. `cledger install qwen-code` and\n276-  `install gemini-cli` therefore append `>/dev/null 2>&1` to the generated\n277-  command, which reliably fixes it — the redirection routes the command\n278-  through a shell so the work outlives the teardown, at the cost of the\n279-  capture no longer printing its own output (drift warnings included) where\n280-  you can see it. `cledger capture <source> --all` remains the way to watch a\n281-  capture. The real fix belongs upstream (await the hook); until then these","is_error":false,"tool_use_id":"toolu_013UpynTfsCnGkWvueBJNnVb","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"worktree-more-cli-adapters","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger/.claude/worktrees/more-cli-adapters","head":"4fed9c92c790d651bc671f09ab8d881f1641ab11","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"id":"ev2-8d6ea45cdde1359849b00dde80b6a7932a7584c06ce9bec95e36f66dfa0ee048","kind":"conversation_turn","meta":{"actor":{"display":"Evin Tunador","id":"evintunador@gmail.com","type":"human"},"session_id":"d10310cd-8144-4046-87b9-97bbb6ace18c","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.227"},"occurred_at":"2026-08-11T02:18:00.709Z","producer":{"tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger/.claude/worktrees/more-cli-adapters","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"worktree-more-cli-adapters","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"content":"269:## Roadmap\n270-\n271-- **Qwen Code's headless one-shot mode kills a hook mid-write** — verified on\n2